{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "三到五岁独立需要未满足导致妈宝", "content": "三到五岁孩子开始认识独立，探索自己与世界分开、与父母分隔。如果父母不鼓励孩子自己穿鞋、系鞋带、倒牛奶等，孩子会学到“我不行”“我不能独立”，长大后可能成为妈宝。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["独立", "妈宝", "3-5岁"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-3dc91c6aa94d-c001:a012", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-3dc91c6aa94d", "blocks": ["b00021", "b00022"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-3dc91c6aa94d-c001:a013", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "年龄阶段", "reason": "3-5岁独立需要未满足导致妈宝，6-12岁不被鼓励犯错导致卡住，是不同阶段的发展任务。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-3dc91c6aa94d-c001:u014"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "六到十二岁不被鼓励犯错导致卡住", "content": "六到十二岁孩子如果不被鼓励犯错，父母不允许犯错，孩子长大后可能卡在这个阶段。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["犯错", "6-12岁"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-3dc91c6aa94d-c001:a013", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-3dc91c6aa94d", "blocks": ["b00022", "b00023"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-3dc91c6aa94d-c001:a014", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "年龄阶段", "reason": "6-12岁不被鼓励犯错导致卡住，青少年未获独立和犯错允许导致婚姻中卡在反抗，是连续阶段。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-3dc91c6aa94d-c001:u015"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
