{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "大脑发育与心理健康相关，能力增强带来心理需求变化", "content": "大脑发育意味着孩子能力增强，能力增强意味着孩子自身和外界理解及需求产生变化，大脑发育会延展出很多心理需求。婴儿只需安抚、吃饱、换尿布、温度适中、环境安全，长大后心理需要越来越多。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["大脑发育", "心理需求"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-3dc91c6aa94d-c001:a016", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-3dc91c6aa94d", "blocks": ["b00025", "b00026"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-3dc91c6aa94d-c001:a017", "kind": "supports", "condition": "忽略大脑发育与心理健康联系", "reason": "大脑发育与心理健康相关及能力增强带来心理需求变化，支持了忽略这种联系会导致育儿偏颇的判断。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "原关系类型为“causes”，按允许类型修订为“supports”。"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-3dc91c6aa94d-c001:u018"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "忽略大脑与心理健康联系导致育儿偏颇", "content": "如果忽略大脑发育和心理健康的联系，父母很难做好育儿，偏重哪一方面都无法做好，也无法从科学的角度看待育儿。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["大脑发育", "心理健康"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-3dc91c6aa94d-c001:a017", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-3dc91c6aa94d", "blocks": ["b00027"], "source_kind": "A1"}, {"source_id": "s-3dc91c6aa94d", "blocks": ["b00026", "b00027"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "legacy:nl-c-04", "kind": "complements", "condition": "当用户自检是否「忽视大脑发育与心理健康的关系」时；候选补充了忽视该联系会导致育儿偏颇、无法科学看待育儿，共同适用于第三个误区。", "reason": "候选补充了第三个误区的后果和原因，帮助理解其严重性。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-3dc91c6aa94d-c001:u019"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "三岁孩子大脑未发育出道德观，暴力言语不等于暴力倾向", "content": "三岁四岁孩子说“要把你杀了”“把眼睛抠出来”并不代表暴力倾向或潜在犯罪，因为该年龄大脑没有发育出道德观，说这些话和说放一块橡皮泥在身上没有区别。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["道德发展", "暴力言语", "3-4岁"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-3dc91c6aa94d-c001:a018", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-3dc91c6aa94d", "blocks": ["b00028"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-3dc91c6aa94d-c001:a019", "kind": "supports", "condition": "了解大脑发育", "reason": "了解大脑发育后，父母在心理健康方面会少很多焦虑。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-3dc91c6aa94d-c001:u020"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
